  "notes": {
    "t8": {"kind": "title1", "maxW": 1440, "text": "Every class, every mood", "w": 240, "x": 0, "y": 7704},
    "t9": {"kind": "title1", "maxW": 1752, "text": "Home backdrops: every tier, both sizes", "w": 240, "x": 0, "y": 9516},
    "n6": {"fill": "orange", "text": "All 8 classes now have all 7 moods. The Monk row uses its own sheets; the other 7 classes use one packed file each. Level up adds light rays behind the hop; fainted lies the sprite down with its stars circling. Same rules for every class.", "w": 330, "x": 1520, "y": 7944},
    "n1": {
      "fill": "orange",
      "text": "v2 art direction: higher pixel density (96×128 sprites, 1 art pixel = 1 CSS pixel), 4-step shaded ramps lit from the top left, a cool rim light on the right edge, dark tinted outlines, dithered glows. Every hero idles in a 60-frame loop that repeats without a seam. Backdrops, hearts and nav icons are drawn with the same engine so everything shares one light.",
      "w": 330,
      "x": 2240,
      "y": 0
    },
    "n2": {
      "fill": "orange",
      "text": "Scores on the sheet are tushar27x's real Phase 4 calibration (Monk 52 ... Cleric 0). Title and lore are sample text: in the app the LLM writes them, and the static fallback is the class label + habit. Hero level 7 is fixture data.",
      "w": 330,
      "x": 1830,
      "y": 1520
    },
    "n3": {
      "fill": "orange",
      "text": "Moods are now full animated sprite loops from one shared engine, so all 8 classes get all moods (Monk shown here; the matrix further down shows every class). Level up adds light rays behind the hop; fainted lies the sprite down with stars circling.\n\nQualified = score 40+ or the top class. Switching keeps level and lives; 7-day cooldown.",
      "w": 330,
      "x": 1990,
      "y": 2604
    },
    "n4": {
      "fill": "orange",
      "text": "One fixture story across every board: Monk, LV 7, 140/350 XP, 2 of 3 hearts. Mon and Tue active, Wed missed (lost a heart), Thu active (streak 1). It is Friday 18:20 local with no contribution yet, so the hero is Hungry. Sunday is a chosen rest day.\n\nStats and repo names are fixture data, not your real numbers.",
      "w": 340,
      "x": 1880,
      "y": 3884
    },
    "n5": {
      "fill": "orange",
      "text": "Campfire flames flicker, stars twinkle and the hero idles in every tier. Scenes are static pixel art; only those overlays move.",
      "w": 330,
      "x": 1520,
      "y": 6172
    },
